<Base title="About — Aurora Coffee">
  <div class="tim-canvas" data-tim-canvas>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-title" style="grid-area: 2 / 2 / 5 / 16;">About us</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-subheading" style="grid-area: 5 / 2 / 7 / 16;">Two people, one drum roaster, zero shortcuts.</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-body" style="grid-area: 8 / 2 / 13 / 13;">Aurora started in a garage with a popcorn popper and too much ambition. Eight years later we are still small on purpose: every roast is tasted before it ships, and every farm we buy from is one we can name.</div>
    <div class="tim-object tim-text tim-style-body" style="grid-area: 8 / 14 / 13 / 24;">Questions about wholesale or just want to argue about grind size? Come by on a Saturday — the espresso machine is always on.</div>
  </div>
</Base>
